WEBVTT

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:09.500
I see. The Duras have already
advanced this far.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:16.580
Hotsuma and Shusei, watch
closely over Yuki.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:24.630
His powers have yet to fully awaken,
but we'll have need of them.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.400
Who needs his powers?

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.700
Only I know your pain...

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:47.200
Your uncertainty...

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:50.090
Your loneliness...

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:55.360
If only we could be together forever.

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.680
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:11.850
I will not betray you!

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:54.990
Thank you.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.920
Why don't you come and sit with me?

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:11.450
Show me where it hurts.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:19.330
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:22.170
I asked her to take care of the girl.

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:23.840
Everything should be okay.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:24.690
I see.

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:28.620
I hope her family comes
to pick her up soon.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:32.290
It's lonely by yourself.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.390
Something's there...

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:39.200
What?

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.500
Are more Duras lurking around?

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:52.510
The Boundary Between Light and Despair

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.760
We're not done yet?

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:56.890
No...

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:02.610
There's still a lot of material to review,
concerning the Duras-related incident.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:12.810
Shusei, do you think we need his power?

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:19.580
Hotsuma, I know how you feel,

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:23.920
but as Zweilt Guardians,
it's our duty to protect him.

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:30.410
Aren't you going to eat?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.670
No. I'm not hungry.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:39.260
Ibuki-san said she'd send a car to pick us up.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:42.220
She said we should wait here.

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:43.500
All right.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.220
What should we do?

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.160
Should we get lunch somewhere?

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.570
What's going on?

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.280
Have you finished seeing the doctor?

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.780
This...

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:04.540
Oh, did you come to return this?

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:09.580
Thank you for your trouble.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.420
Will your parents be here soon?

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:13.500
I bet you want to go home.

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:19.760
I don't want to go home...

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.260
Why not?

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.390
So that's what it is...

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.460
Is it a Duras?

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.450
Yes.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:37.610
Then go. I'll be fine.

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:40.700
Stay there.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:04.820
Let's go wait over there.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:21.820
Where'd he go?

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:30.000
Not again!

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.810
I see.

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:03.280
Is that your father?

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.960
No! Let go of me!

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:18.040
Please stop! Let her go!

00:07:18.760 --> 00:07:20.420
What do you think you're doing?

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:23.200
Oh, shit!

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:38.440
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.030
You really are an idiot.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.820
Why did you approach a
suspicious guy like that?

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.810
Talk about reckless!

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:53.830
Hotsuma-kun, u-uh...

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:57.540
I'm sorry.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.400
You don't look sorry!

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:04.130
Why are you smiling, when you're
being yelled at, you moron?

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.590
I'm sorry.

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:09.190
I didn't mean any harm.

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:14.170
You're upset because you
care about me, right?

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:17.590
I'm just happy you care.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:24.270
Are you really that same Yuki?

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:30.780
Mister!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.280
What's wrong?

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.020
That...

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:37.500
What?

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:51.800
He's a Duras, huh?

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:05.130
Looks like he brought some friends...

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:18.790
Creatures of darkness,
burn in the fires of Hell!

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:27.550
Shusei.

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:29.180
Yes, sir.

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:35.930
Cut space.

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:42.140
Lock set!

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:06.370
I'll be back.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.350
Shusei.

00:10:10.930 --> 00:10:12.260
Not yet.

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:18.770
Burn!

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:29.870
Damn it! There's no end to these guys.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:40.680
What's wrong with them?

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:23.350
Luka.

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:26.040
Are you all right, Yuki?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.200
Yes.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:28.750
I see.

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.860
How did things go on your end, Luka?

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:33.790
He was the bait.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:39.490
If his bodyguard falls for stupid tricks,
what are we supposed to do?

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:40.750
Look who's talking.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:42.460
What was that?

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:48.230
Look.

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:53.010
Someone put this inside.
They're nothing but mud dolls.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:53.820
What?

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:57.030
So that means...

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:05.410
Someone's controlling them
from a distance?

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:12.310
Where's the puppet master?

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:14.890
I can sense presences,
but there are too many.

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:17.440
Huh? Then what are we supposed to do?

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:19.260
We can't just ignore these.
We'll be overrun.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:21.460
Buy some time.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:25.600
We'll start by taking out the trash.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:36.820
I invoke you, with an ancient incantation
from the darkest abyss.

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:43.390
I call upon our blood pact,
to awaken you from eternity's flow.

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:48.830
Will you throw yourself upon the brimstone,
offering your blood alongside mine?

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.840
Treating me like your sidekick...

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.170
You want me to take care of it, right?

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:56.290
Then I'll take care of it!

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.900
Master stroke!

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:15.710
Yuki, take the kid and stand back!

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:16.610
Okay.

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:31.920
Burn, dark ones!

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:36.880
Hey, how long are you going to stand there?

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:40.280
Show your dark master your will,
and follow me.

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:45.350
Your power will be resurrected,
like those blazing crimson eyes!

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:47.350
Come, king of beasts!

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.730
King of beasts?

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:54.360
Salamander!

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:15.710
You can't be serious.

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:23.320
You bastard!

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.210
They're all dead...

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.120
Not yet.

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:47.990
I can still sense the Duras.

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.210
What?

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.310
Yuki!

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.920
Don't move!

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:59.420
If you care for your friend,
you'll do as I say.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:03.180
Damn it! That girl is possessed by a Duras.

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:05.620
I knew it. That mark...

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:11.430
I'm really lucky to have
found God's Light here.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:18.210
He said that if I killed you,
he'd grant me any wish.

00:15:18.210 --> 00:15:19.860
He...

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:23.260
I can't release her.

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:24.320
I know.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:31.200
I need to create some kind of opening...

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:36.870
What?

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:40.750
I'm scared.

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:45.010
I don't want to do this...

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.700
Help me.

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:55.940
<i>Come on, already!</i>

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:59.360
<i>You're always forcing her on
me because of your work!</i>

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.610
<i>Taking care of her children
is a mother's job!</i>

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:03.660
<i>What did you say?</i>

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.260
<i>Daddy...</i>

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:10.620
<i>Go away. I'm busy.</i>

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.400
<i>Mommy...</i>

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:19.170
<i>Mommy.</i>

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:20.920
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:25.800
Am I a bad girl?

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:28.480
Is that why they don't want me?

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:33.080
I'll be a good girl.

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:39.180
I'll be a good girl...

00:16:40.590 --> 00:16:47.130
Stay out of this!
No one needs you!

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:48.070
No.

00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:49.740
What?

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:51.830
It's not this girl's fault.

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:56.920
Leave her body...

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:02.710
What?

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.720
Can this be...

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:15.470
Get out!

00:17:17.920 --> 00:17:19.440
I release you.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.080
You're late, Shusei.

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:45.590
Finish her, Hotsuma.

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:47.210
Got it.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:50.930
What is this?
Release me from this cage!

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:53.180
I can't believe your dirty tricks.

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:59.640
I can't stand people like you!

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:13.160
Everyone, good work.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:15.350
Takashiro-san.

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:16.930
Are you all right, Yuki?

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:17.890
Yes.

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:21.160
Shusei, dispel the barrier.

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:22.510
Yes, sir.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:23.670
The barrier...

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:28.050
Oft.

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:41.310
Everything's back to normal.

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:46.650
Using Shusei's barrier,
we quarantined this area.

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:50.530
It prevents actions in here
from affecting the real world.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.850
Uh, who is Shusei?

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:57.240
Right. Allow me to properly introduce you.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:04.380
Usui Shusei, known as the Seer,
wielder of God's Eyes.

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:10.680
And his partner, Renjo Hotsuma.
Wielder of God's Voice

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:12.760
and known as the Incinerator.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:16.610
They're Zweilt Guardians and your allies.

00:19:16.610 --> 00:19:18.220
My allies...

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:20.070
Yuki.

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:20.850
Yes?

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.230
Give them the girl.

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:36.140
Takashiro-san, that girl...

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:39.450
Don't worry. We'll take care of everything.

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:43.080
I never thought such a small girl
could be possessed by a Duras.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:46.810
All humans hold darkness in their hearts.

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:50.210
Duras invade that darkness,
changing them into enemies.

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:51.580
No.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:54.590
Not even a kid can let her guard down.

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:00.140
Only the blood seals,
which they inscribe, reveal them.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:08.620
They're not always visible, and Duras are
otherwise impossible to distinguish.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:10.000
No.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:13.450
However, there is one exception.

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:20.230
High-level Duras, known as Opasts,
take on beautiful human forms.

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:22.910
They draw humans to them,
to deceive them.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:26.220
Is Luka an Opast?

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:30.180
In any case, trust no one!

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:32.260
Stay away from people!
Don't walk around alone!

00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:33.120
Hotsuma.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:33.760
What?

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:39.570
It's not like you to suffer an injury
from fighting a Mid-Villain.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:42.690
This is different. It's his fault.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:47.600
It seems you took care of Hotsuma.

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.300
Not really.

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.100
Let's go, Shusei.

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:53.980
Okay.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.600
I've asked someone to come
and pick you up.

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.280
I don't need it.

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:04.060
It seems he's having a powerful
effect on you.

00:21:04.060 --> 00:21:06.230
What do I care about him?

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:12.910
All I know is, I can only work with
someone I can trust with my life.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.410
You're quite the wordsmith.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:20.100
I didn't just make that up.
It's what I believe...

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:25.740
I suppose I should thank you
for trusting me so much.

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:29.820
You trust me with your life, too, don't you?

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:33.110
That's a little scary.

00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:35.680
Are you frightened?

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:36.570
Huh?

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:41.050
Not at all. If my power is
good for something...

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:43.580
If I can save people, like that girl,

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.830
I'm willing to fight.

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.020
Strangely charming...

00:21:52.610 --> 00:21:54.670
You've grown into a good kid.

00:21:55.730 --> 00:22:00.090
I hate having to deceive you.

00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:03.570
Yuki...

00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:36.170
Yuki.

00:23:36.170 --> 00:23:37.570
What is it, Luka?

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:39.980
Vegetable cutters are amazing.

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:40.390
What?

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:44.200
Look at the consistent thickness
of this shredded cabbage.

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:45.990
You really like modern conveniences,
don't you?

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:47.970
The Twilight Mansion

00:23:47.970 --> 00:23:49.130
I do, actually.

00:23:49.130 --> 00:23:49.780
The Twilight Mansion
